From a920e7fe18464eaaa272f6a1f3d6c2ceff6889ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: warelik <warelik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:36:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] Keep logs in --user-data-dir and isolate crash-handler
 log directories

On macOS write logs under the user data directory when one is given,
and forward the resolved log directory to the crash-handler and remote
server subprocesses.

